      "reachability": "Bearer tokens go to the API origin configured at build time. Local loopback HTTP is a development default, not evidence of a remote TLS deployment. A compromised/mistaken build origin or remote plain HTTP could expose credentials. Dev script binds all interfaces; current network reachability was not tested.",
