      "reachability": "With VITE_MOCK_API=true, an administrator can select a small but highly compressed XLSX and trigger ExcelJS parsing before row-count checks. Expanded ZIP totals are not enforced by the browser mock. Resource exhaustion was not reproduced. With real API mode, the UI forwards FormData and does not locally parse the XLSX.",
